<title>BANGLADESH: Singer Bangladesh 1996 profit up 32.6 percent.</title>
<headline>Singer Bangladesh 1996 profit up 32.6 percent.</headline>
<dateline>DHAKA 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The year ended on December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>			 (In million taka unless stated)</p>
<p>			    1996		   1995</p>
<p>    Turnover	    1,143.07    vs     1,009.22</p>
<p>    Net profit	  139.24	vs     105.02</p>
<p>    Gross profit	216.12	vs     176.21</p>
<p>    Dividend	    75 taka on 100-taka share vs 81 percent</p>
<p>Note - Singer Bangladesh Limited, a subsidiary of Singer International Limited held its annual general meeting on Wednesday. The company also offered a one-for-one bonus share for the year</p>
</text>
